\fs22 \cf3 Key point: State code 1 (ASCENT) serves double duty. The thrust flag distinguishes boost (thrust=1) from coast (thrust=0). The ground station maps this to two separate display states: BOOST and COAST. The altimeter must set the thrust flag correctly for this mapping to work.
