6. Event Sentences\
\pard\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs22 \cf3 One-shot sentences emitted at key flight events. These are in addition to the periodic $PYRO sentence. Each event sentence is sent exactly once when the event occurs. The tracker uses these to generate LoRa event packets with precise altimeter-measured values.
\fs32 \cf2 \
\pard\sa240\partightenfactor0

