\fs32 \cf2 7. Flags Bitfield\
\pard\sa240\partightenfactor0

\fs22 \cf3 The flags field (field 9) is a hex-encoded bitfield. The altimeter currently uses bits 0 through 5 (transmitted as 2-character hex, e.g. 3F). The tracker has infrastructure to receive and forward 16-bit extended flags (4-character hex), but the altimeter does not set bits 6-11 yet.
