\fs22 \cf3 Why LANDED state_id matters: The ground station's auto-complete logic checks specifically for 
\f3\fs20 flightState === 3
\f0\fs22  (after DSM mapping to GS code 4). If the altimeter sends an unrecognized state code when landed, the flight will never auto-complete. It will eventually transition to RECOVERY (no telemetry for 60s) and stay stuck there until an operator manually completes it.
